      "message": "I suspect this function is used quite heavily, so adding function calls inside it might affect allocation times. You could have:\n```\nextern int __kmalloc_min_size;\nextern int __kmalloc_shift_low;\n```\ndefinitions here and use the variables directly, just do not EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL them.",
